  "description": "Woong Ja, a college student who was on leave, suddenly worked as an idol's personal manager.  Turns out, the idol named Beom Ho was a descendant of the ho clan (tiger clan), who failed to become completely human and must live their lives as half-human half-animal. Well, for Beom Ho to become a complete human he must find Woong Nyeo's descendant and mate with them. He approaches her aggressively, but for a girl like her, normal methods will not get through. Will he be able to successfully turn human with so many obstacles in his way?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://page.kakao.com/home/49899304)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Indonesian](https://id.kakaowebtoon.com/content/My-Lovely-Woong-Ja/463), French, [Japanese](https://piccoma.com/web/product/9353)",
